.TH BASH\-IT\-DPKG 7 "Feb 2026" "bash-it-dpkg 1.0.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
bash\-it\-dpkg \- System\-wide bash\-it framework
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.I bash\-it\-dpkg
package provides a system\-wide installation of
.BR bash\-it ,
a framework for managing bash configurations.
It installs to
.RI /opt/bash-it
and allows per\-user activation via
.B bashitctl enable .

All users share one copy; personal settings go to
.RI ~/.bash_it .
.SH COMMANDS
.IP "\fBbashitctl enable\fR"
Activate for current user.
.IP "\fBbashitctl disable\fR"
Deactivate.
.IP "\fBbashitctl status\fR"
Show activation status.
.SH FILES
.IP "\fB/opt/bash-it/\fR"
Core framework.
.IP "\fB/etc/profile.d/bash-it.sh\fR"
Auto\-loads bash-it if enabled.
.IP "\fB~/.bash_it/enable\fR"
Flag file controlling activation.
.IP "\fB~/.bash_it/enabled/\fR"
User\-specific symlinks to active plugins/aliases.
.IP "\fB~/.bash_it/custom/\fR"
User\-owned directory for custom extensions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bash (1),
.BR profile (5)
.SH AUTHOR
